	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0260f7862aa6d1e4","x":-180,"y":-200,"width":780,"height":2900,"type":"file","file":"📁/🧠/🎓/1731657856731/1738139590772.md"},
		{"id":"b20bdd93450b9e2d","x":680,"y":1560,"width":869,"height":1254,"type":"text","text":"Regarding the attached email from Ms. Majdoullin with regards to the MCRE Sales Operations Managers Commission Structure, here are the detailed points as discussed with Mr. Mustapha, and the same has been reviewed and approved by Mr. Mustapha and Mr. Issam.\n\n**Updated List of Brand Developers under the HOS** \n\n**Mr. Issam's Developers include: Modon, Bloom, Advanced, SAAS, and Ora.**\n\n**Mr. Mustapha's  Developers include: AlDar, Eagle Hills, Taraf, Burtville, and Sotheby (Al Saadiyat Projects).**\n\n**Sales Operations Managers (Launch Deals)**\n\n**1.  Ahlam and Ranine will be taking a bonus worth AED 350 per deal (Below 2 Million- Selling Price) and 500 per deal (Above 2 Million - Selling Price) based on the above developers assigned to any HOS during Launching.**\n\n**Ahlam will be taking the above Bonus based only on the closed deals of the agents under Mr. Mustapha**\n\n**Ranine  will be taking the above Bonus based only on the closed deals of the agents under Mr. Issam**\n\nIf MPP or RAK Agents closed a deal on any of the above developers during launching Ranine and Ahlam are not entitled to the above Bonus.\n\n1. Ranine and Ahlam have to send to the DC dept. the list of closed deals under them after the launching to double-check whether the deals have been added in the system, and the same list has to be submitted by the DC dept. to Mr. Issam and Mr. Mustapha to get their confirmation/ verification on whether the deals on the list are under launching or not and if they are entitled to the above Bonus. (DC will be sending them an official email to inform them about the process)\n\n**3. Starting Date - Dec. 1, 2024**\n\n**Sales Operations Managers (Brand Developers)**\n\n**1. Assignment of Tasks:**\n\nMr. Issam and Mr. Mustapha will no longer act as brand managers for the designated below list of developers and will remove their names in 1C and these developers to be re-assigned to Ranine and Ahlam. \n\n**- Ranine's Assigned Developers: Boardwalk, Radiant, Reportage, Ams, 9 Yards, and Ventura.**\n\n**- Ahlam’s Assigned Developers: Imkan, NIC, Tiger, Four Seasons (Al Maryah Project Only), and Baraka.**\n\n**2. Starting Date for Brand Manager (Ranine and Ahlam) - February 1, 2025.**\n\n**3. Commission Structure:** Brand developers will receive a commission of 2% based on the company’s NET.\n\n2. If the above developers assigned to Ranine and Ahlam as brand managers have new projects and are under launch - Ranine and Ahlam will still be entitled to the Bonus structure above during launching."},
		{"id":"5d8f85a6030d6006","x":725,"y":1050,"width":780,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"# Kyle\n\n| Task                                        | Issue             | Estimate (hours) |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------- |\n|                                             | Inclement Weather |                  |\n| Performance Document Bugfixes for V10       |                   | 3                |\n| Top Transactions from Property Monitor      |                   | 2                |\n| Top Dubai Island 2024 Projects by Developer |                   | 3                |\n| Hot Property Fliers                         | 1 No Agent Photo  | 1                |\n| Google Analytics Module 2 Course 3          |                   |                  |\n| Migration of Python Scripts to Google Colab |                   |                  |\n"},
